Disclaimer: The official patch notes combined both v1.9.7.7 and [[v1.9.7.8]] changes, only v1.9.7.7 changes will be documented here.

== Documented changes ==
* Added a rumble option for controllers into the menu.
* Added <code>repentance_plus</code> global variable and removed <code>repentance</code> global variable.
* Added a charging tears animation to co-op ghost babies.
* {{i|Flush!}} now works on {{e|Turdlings}}.
* Co-op ghosts are now able to fire out tiny bombs in [[Deathmatch]].
* Void portal is now guaranteed after defeating {{e|Mother}} if the Mother ending has been seen once by any character.
* Blocked {{i|Lil Portal}} from spawning portals in Angel Shop, Secret Shop, Crawlspaces, and Black Markets

=== Fixes ===
* Attempted a fix to forbid mods in online.
* Fixed {{i|Abyss}} locusts not remembering their quality when exiting and continuing a run, or when flipping back to a form with locusts as {{c|Tainted Lazarus}}.
* Fixed the dice from {{t|Dice Bag}} being invisible in the [[HUD]].
* Fixed tears not hurting {{e|Spider}}s from {{i|Dark Bum}} or {{e|Dip}}s from flushed poop bosses.
* Fixed the oddities that happen when you exit and continue in {{e|Mother}}'s arena after killing her (no exit door appears, no invisible wall blocks off the void portal now).
* Fixed crashes caused by {{i|C Section}} shots from familiars like clots and {{c|Tainted Lilith}}'s Gello.
* Various API fixes.

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Fixes ===
* Fixed {{c|Bethany}} being revived with one and a half soul heart in online runs.

